cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AURA, please cite it as below."
title: "AURA: Calibrated Per-Carrier Confidence and Certified Pruning for Gaussian-Splat Assets"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Attri
    given-names: Krishi
    email: krishiattriwork@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-4695-6467"
version: 1.0.2
date-released: 2026-07-22
repository-code: "https://github.com/Archerkattri/aura"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - gaussian splatting
  - uncertainty calibration
  - conformal prediction
  - neural rendering
  - level-of-detail
abstract: >-
  AURA attaches a trustworthy per-carrier confidence to trained Gaussian-splat
  assets: a held-out multi-view reliability label, isotonic (PAVA) calibration of
  an export-time feature, and a distribution-free split-conformal pruning
  certificate extended into a certified level-of-detail ladder, delivered through
  glTF (KHR_gaussian_splatting), OpenUSD, and SPZ interchange.
